{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-25766-r4523490","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Rigatoni Pasta with Ricotta in Tomato Cream Sauce","sourcePageId":25766,"sourceRevision":"4523490","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-07-13T19:17:29Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Rigatoni%20Pasta%20with%20Ricotta%20in%20Tomato%20Cream%20Sauce&oldid=4523490","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:46:23.524Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Boiled recipes","Category:Easy recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for pasta sauce","Category:Recipes using basil","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using garlic","Category:Recipes using granulated sugar","Category:Recipes using heavy cream","Category:Recipes using parmesan","Category:Recipes using pasta","Category:Recipes using ricotta","Category:Recipes using tomato","Category:Vegetarian recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"32c3f2764f4a9f7cd7d11b64b0413cbcf2f3814f9265df0598e6b36b221c0869","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Pasta recipes|servings=6|time=45 minutes|difficulty=2}}\n\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Pasta Recipes|Pasta Recipes]]\n\nPasta with ricotta cheese in a tomato cream sauce topped with Parmesan cheese and parsley.\n==Ingredients==\n*16 [[Cookbook:Ounce|oz]] rigatoni (or other) [[Cookbook:Pasta|pasta]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]]\n*1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] finely-[[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Onion|onions]]\n*3 [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]] cloves, [[Cookbook:Mince|minced]]\n*1 can (28 oz) plum [[Cookbook:Tomato|tomatoes]], drained and chopped \n*1 ½ cups tomato sauce\n*2 tbsp fresh minced [[Cookbook:Basil|basil]]\n*½ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] fresh minced [[Cookbook:Oregano|oregano]]\n*½ tsp [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n*⅛ tsp black [[Cookbook:Pepper|pepper]]\n*16 oz [[Cookbook:Ricotta|ricotta cheese]]\n*1 cup [[Cookbook:Cream|heavy cream]]\n*1 ½ tsp [[Cookbook:Granulated Sugar|granulated sugar]]\n*¼ cup [[Cookbook:Parsley|parsley]], chopped\n*½ cup [[Cookbook:Grating|grated]] [[Cookbook:Parmesan Cheese|Parmesan cheese]]\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# In a large pot bring 2 quarts of lightly salted water to a [[Cookbook:Boiling|boil]].\n# Cook rigatoni pasta for 11 minutes (or until [[Cookbook:Al Dente|al dente]]), drain and set aside until needed.\n# Over medium heat, melt butter and heat oil in a large [[Cookbook:Frying Pan|skillet]].\n# Lightly [[Cookbook:Sautéing|sauté]] onions and garlic cloves, don't brown. Cook about 5 minutes.\n# Drain canned tomatoes, dice and add to skillet with onions and garlic.\n# Also add to skillet tomato sauce, basil, oregano, salt and pepper. [[Cookbook:Simmering|Simmer]] 20 minutes.\n# Stir in ricotta cheese. Mix well and simmer for 5 minutes.\n# Stir in heavy cream and sugar. Mix well and simmer 5 minutes.\n# Remove from heat and add to cooked rigatoni pasta. Mix well.\n# Stir in chopped parsley and sprinkle grated Parmesan cheese over top.\n# Serve hot.\n\n[[Category:Vegetarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pasta]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tomato]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ricotta]]\n[[Category:Recipes for pasta sauce]]\n[[Category:Boiled recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using basil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using granulated sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using butter]]\n[[Category:Recipes using parmesan]]\n[[Category:Recipes using heavy cream]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Rigatoni Pasta with Ricotta in Tomato Cream Sauce","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"16 oz rigatoni (or other) pasta","sourceText":"16 oz rigatoni (or other) pasta","amountText":"16 oz rigatoni (or other) pasta","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"2 tbsp olive oil","sourceText":"2 tbsp olive oil","amountText":"2 tbsp olive oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 tbsp butter","sourceText":"1 tbsp butter","amountText":"1 tbsp butter","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 cup finely-chopped onions","sourceText":"1 cup finely-chopped onions","amountText":"1 cup finely-chopped onions","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"3 garlic cloves, minced","sourceText":"3 garlic cloves, minced","amountText":"3 garlic cloves, minced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 can (28 oz) plum tomatoes, drained and chopped","sourceText":"1 can (28 oz) plum tomatoes, drained and chopped","amountText":"1 can (28 oz) plum tomatoes, drained and chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"1 ½ cups tomato sauce","sourceText":"1 ½ cups tomato sauce","amountText":"1 ½ cups tomato sauce","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"2 tbsp fresh minced basil","sourceText":"2 tbsp fresh minced basil","amountText":"2 tbsp fresh minced basil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-9","name":"½ tsp fresh minced oregano","sourceText":"½ tsp fresh minced oregano","amountText":"½ tsp fresh minced oregano","